| library source | src | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| library tests | src/__tests__ | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| components | src/components | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| state context | src/context | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| hooks | src/hooks | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| icons | src/icons | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| locales | src/locales | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |
| themes | src/themes | src/AGENTS.md | everything else |

## Exclusions

- `.git/` — excluded because it is worktree metadata, not repository context.
- `node_modules/` — excluded because it is a generated dependency cache.
- `dist/` — excluded because it is generated library output.
- `coverage/` — excluded because it is generated test output.
- `apps/docs/.astro/` — excluded because it is generated documentation output.
- `apps/docs/.netlify/` — excluded because it is a generated deployment cache.

An unlisted directory is a gap in this file, not ignorable.

## Universal STOP rules

- STOP before considering a change complete unless the required checks have run — why: incomplete verification can ship regressions. See `src/AGENTS.md` under “Commands”.

No ADR or architecture record currently exists in the repository; add any future decision record to its owning area contract because decisions must remain reachable from this catalog.

